| Property | Value |
|---|---|
| Base body | Clear transparent hourglass |
| Caps / limbs | Dark grey |
| Sand | Warm bright gold |
| Eyes | Large joined white cartoon eyes |
| Mist | Violet, thin, stylized, readable |
| Fogging | Minimal internal patches only |
| Outline | Crisp black / dark grey |
| Style | 2D flat cartoon, clean vector |
| Priority | Sandy recognizability first |

