По стратегической задаче — вы правы. Это надо фиксировать не как разовую правку, а как **production technology + role skill**, причём жанрозависимо.

## Где фиксировать системно

### 1. Bible / General idea → раздел “Production Technology”
Туда пишем канон уровня сериала:

```md
## Production Technology: Camera as Comedy Instrument

For SandyStudio minimalist action-comedy episodes, camera is not passive coverage.
Camera movement is an active tool for comedy rhythm, emotional pressure, spatial distortion, and punchline contrast.

Default for action-comedy:
- avoid static wide/medium/close-up coverage as the main language;
- use purposeful camera movement every few seconds when it supports the gag;
- use stillness only as contrast, especially for deadpan punchlines.

Camera movement palette:
- push-in / pull-back;
- orbit / circular drift;
- whip-pan / snap reframe;
- parallax shelf/space movement;
- Dutch tilt / elastic wobble;
- micro-shake during chaos;
- locked-off stillness for punchline contrast.

Genre rule:
Camera behavior must match the type of work.
Action-comedy may use frequent dynamic camera moves.
Tender melancholy may use slower drift, pull-back, locked-off pauses.
Dialogue/minimal episodes may use restrained camera with precise reframes.
Surreal distortion episodes may use orbit, parallax, tilt, elastic camera.
```

### 2. Storyboard Artist skill → обязательный навык
В skill нужно добавить:

```md
Storyboard Artist must specify camera behavior per shot:
- framing alone is not enough;
- every shot requires intentional camera movement or intentional stillness;
- camera movement must support the beat, not decorate it;
- preserve approved script timing and shot structure unless explicitly asked to restructure;
- for camera-only revision, do not change story, shot count, timing, characters, location, or gag order.
```

### 3. Genre / format technology files
Нужна отдельная библиотека “Technology by Format/Genre”:

```text
technology/
  camera_general.md
  camera_action_comedy.md
  camera_tender_melancholy.md
  camera_dialogue_minimal.md
  camera_surreal_distortion.md
  storyboard_artist_skill.md
```

И в задачу Storyboard Artist каждый раз надо передавать не просто “make storyboard”, а:

```text
Apply camera profile: action_comedy / surreal_distortion / tender_melancholy
```

## Что это решает

- Мы не хардкодим один стиль камеры на все случаи.
- Артист получает правильный “skill context”.
- Для каждого жанра будет своя уместность:
  - action — больше движения;
  - melancholy — меньше, точнее;
  - surreal — деформация камеры;
  - dialogue — restrained reframing.

## Что надо зафиксировать как стратегическую задачу для Claude

```text
Create production technology layer for SandyStudio.

Add:
1. Bible section: Production Technology / Camera as Comedy Instrument.
2. Storyboard Artist skill update: per-shot camera_movement is required.
3. Genre camera profiles:
   - action_comedy
   - tender_melancholy
   - dialogue_minimal
   - surreal_distortion
4. Storyboard output schema update:
   each shot must include:
   - camera_angle
   - camera_movement
   - camera_motivation
5. Camera-only revision rule:
   when Director asks for camera-only revision, Storyboard Artist must not alter story, timing, shot count, characters, location, or gag order.
```

