When Director requests revision on an image asset:
- create explicit revision task for Reference Artist;
- pass review notes + Director note into corrected prompt;
- auto-trigger regeneration unless Director chooses “notes only”;
- mark old asset SUPERSEDED_BY_REVISION when v+1 appears;
- show revision chain in UI;
- do not count rejected/superseded assets as pending;
- stage cannot be approved while any ref asset is REVIEW/REVISION_REQUESTED or required shot coverage is missing;
- emit events: revision_requested, regeneration_started, regeneration_completed/failed.
```

